; audit-evidence-index-cache.fk - ensure the dynamic audit evidence index .fkb.
;
; aec-ensure-index-cache lives in form-stdlib/audit-evidence-cache.fk (split out
; 2026-08-15); aec-index-cache-path stayed behind in form-stdlib/audit-evidence-cells.fk.
; Both are needed. write_form_binary / read_form_binary underneath are a
; documented go/rust/ts-only lane seam -- fkwu cannot run this write path at
; all, so the rust arm is the honest witness. aec-index-cache-path anchors to
; form/form-stdlib/.cache/... (commit 31019d77, 2026-09-03), so this now runs
; from the repo root, not from form/:
;
;   form/form-kernel-rust/target/release/form-kernel-rust form/form-stdlib/json.fk form/form-stdlib/audit-evidence-cells.fk form/form-stdlib/audit-evidence-cache.fk form/form-stdlib/queries/audit-evidence-index-cache.fk

(aec-ensure-index-cache ".." (aec-index-cache-path))
